      "text": "Database (database.py) + SQLite (mint.db)\n\u2022 UNIQUE(account_id, external_id)\n\u2022 COMPOSITE INDEX(user_id, created_at) -> 63.6x faster\n\u2022 UPSERT ON CONFLICT(user_id, category)",
